<main>
<div class="page">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-tag">Operational Observation · 2026</div>
    <h1>Momentum<br>Made the<br><em>Decision</em></h1>
  </div>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <!-- BODY -->
  <div class="body-section">
    <p>No one intended the failure.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="body-section">
    <p>Legal reviewed.<br>
    Risk escalated.<br>
    Engineering raised concerns.<br>
    Executives approved.</p>

    <p>No one explicitly decided to ignore uncertainty.</p>

    <div class="stack">
      <div class="stack-line">The deadline remained.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">The customer was waiting.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">Revenue mattered.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">Escalation circulated.</div>
    </div>

    <p>Momentum made the decision.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="body-section">
    <p>Until something failed.</p>
    <p>Then the question changed.</p>
    <p>Not: <em>who approved?</em></p>
    <p>But: <em>who was responsible for stopping it?</em></p>
  </div>

  <div class="break">
    <p>Organizations rarely fail because nobody cared.<br>
    They fail because <em>continuation survives uncertainty</em><br>
    while interruption remains undefined.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="body-section">
    <p>This is how organizations continue without deciding.</p>

    <div class="stack">
      <div class="stack-line">Nobody decides to continue.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">Continuation happens.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">Nobody removes the authority to stop.</div>
      <div class="stack-line">The authority quietly disappears.</div>
    </div>

    <p>No conspiracy. No negligence. No single decision.<br>
    Gravity.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="indictment">
    <p>When momentum takes over, <strong>who, by name,</strong> still has the authority to stop?</p>

    <div class="not-list">
      <div class="not-item">Not review.</div>
      <div class="not-item">Not advise.</div>
      <div class="not-item">Not escalate.</div>
      <div class="yes-item">Stop.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="body-section">
    <p>This is not a question about competence.<br>
    It is a question about structure.<br>
    And most structures do not answer it.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- CLOSING -->
  <div class="closing">
    <div class="closing-line">If it cannot wait,<br>it is no longer a decision.<br>It is momentum.</div>
    <div class="sig">Liran Bar-Shrim · matrix-audit.com · 2026</div>
  </div>

</div>
</main>

